From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MrLu1z <273601560+MrLu1z@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 00:00:01 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] pmdomain: samsung: add Exynos7880 pd_g3d

Add the G3D power domain for Exynos7880. The local_pwr_cfg value
(0x7) is a placeholder based on Exynos4210 and must be confirmed
in S5E7880-pmusfr.h.

NOT TESTED on hardware.

Signed-off-by: MrLu1z <273601560+MrLu1z@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 drivers/pmdomain/samsung/exynos-pm-domains.c | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/pmdomain/samsung/exynos-pm-domains.c b/drivers/pmdomain/samsung/exynos-pm-domains.c
index 000000000000..333333333333 100644
--- a/drivers/pmdomain/samsung/exynos-pm-domains.c
+++ b/drivers/pmdomain/samsung/exynos-pm-domains.c
@@ -68,6 +68,10 @@ static const struct exynos_pm_domain_config exynos5433_cfg = {
 	.local_pwr_cfg		= 0xf,
 };
 
+static const struct exynos_pm_domain_config exynos7880_cfg = {
+	.local_pwr_cfg		= 0x7, /* TODO: confirm in S5E7880-pmusfr.h */
+};
+
 static const struct of_device_id exynos_pm_domain_of_match[] = {
 	{
 		.compatible = "samsung,exynos4210-pd",
@@ -76,6 +80,9 @@ static const struct of_device_id exynos_pm_domain_of_match[] = {
 	}, {
 		.compatible = "samsung,exynos5433-pd",
 		.data = &exynos5433_cfg,
+	}, {
+		.compatible = "samsung,exynos7880-pd",
+		.data = &exynos7880_cfg,
 	},
 	{ },
 };
-- 
2.43.0
